{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2484438","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年八丈岛小苍兰节","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-04-01","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · いざ八丈島へ！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2484438/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一从羽田飞往八丈岛，参加小苍兰节活动，期待明天与10米高皮卡丘见面。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","イベント"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · いざ八丈島へ！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2484438.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160405003841id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2484438.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">到四月了呢！<br>\n总觉得<br>\n这是个令人心情雀跃的季节！<br>\n<br>\n就在今天<br>\nGAME FREAK</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">举行了全公司交流会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n本期有10位新人加入公司。<br>\n今后，他们一定会大显身手吧！<br>\n希望大家都能充满活力地努力！<br>\n期待值超高！！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n增田也讲了几件事……<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n然后……<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n一个人前往羽田机场！<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/001-12fb4b33ae.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/001-12fb4b33ae.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1115-COLLAGE\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure><br>\n嗯？<br>\n 啊？<br>\n因为天气恶劣，可能会返航？？ <br>\n<br>\n哎——————！！？？<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/002-944c2dd80c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/002-944c2dd80c.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1125-COLLAGE\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure><br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/003-e6e0848dcc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/003-e6e0848dcc.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1130\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"929\"></a></figure><br>\n<br>\n <br>\n呜哇————！<br>\n好险啊————！！！<br>\n能平安抵达真是太好了！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n <a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.infiorata88.com/freesia2016/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2016八丈岛小苍兰节</a><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n就是为了这个才来的！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n好期待明天的活动！<br>\n好期待10米高的皮卡丘！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n第一次来到八丈岛！<br>\n我要好好享受这里！！！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">４月になりましたね！<br>\nなんとなく<br>\nワクワクする季節です！<br>\n<br>\nそんな本日<br>\nゲームフリークでは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">全社共有会を行いました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n今期は１０人の新人さんが入社。<br>\nこの先、必ず活躍してくれるでしょう！<br>\n活き活きと頑張って欲しい！<br>\n期待大！！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nマスダもいくつか語り・・・<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nそして・・・<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n一人、羽田空港へ！<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/001-12fb4b33ae.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/001-12fb4b33ae.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1115-COLLAGE\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure><br>\nん？<br>\n あれ？<br>\n天候不良のため引き返す場合あり？？ <br>\n<br>\nえーーーーーーー！！？？<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/002-944c2dd80c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/002-944c2dd80c.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1125-COLLAGE\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure><br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/003-e6e0848dcc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2484438/003-e6e0848dcc.webp\" alt=\"IMG_1130\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"929\"></a></figure><br>\n<br>\n <br>\nうおーーーー！<br>\nあっぶなーーい！！！<br>\n無事到着できてよかった！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n <a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.infiorata88.com/freesia2016/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">八丈島フリージアまつり2016</a><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nこのためにやってきました！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n明日のイベントが楽しみです！<br>\n10mピカチュウ楽しみです！<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n初めて来た八丈島！<br>\n堪能します！！！</div>"}}